{"author":{"id":"8d2e0405f08ac6c481f912544d6d5c0f58b2dc14a7e51ad4d499ee7a34567943"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794228995,"nonce":"UdxMFk60t26nkTSgRLnWf/G1L5c=","title":"Named box faces of a CSG cut also tag the cut's own faces","message":"In 3-D, (box - box).name(...) + box(...) tags the walls of the cut-out hole as left/right/front/back and the hole's floor as bottom: d.variable('left') spans x in [0, 0.5] on a [0, 2] cell whose hole wall is at x = 0.5, and 'bottom' spans z in [0, 1] where the floor is z = 0 and the hole floor z = 1. A Dirichlet condition on 'bottom' or a roller on 'left' then also pins the inside of the hole, silently. Workaround: select faces by coordinate with d.variable(name, where=...). Expected: the outer-face names cover the outer faces only, or the ambiguity raises.","files":null}]}